(ix) digital trade facilitation;
(x) AI and other emerging technology; and
(xi) digital government;
(b) encourage industry, as appropriate, to develop  methods of self -
regulation that foster the digital economy, including codes of conduct,
model contracts, guidelines and enforcement mechanisms; and
(c) exchange information and share best practices on simplified customs
procedures applied to expedited shipments.
